        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: There are no pairs that satisfy the condition.\nTest case 222: There is one pair possible :\n\n(4,5)(4,5)(4,5) : a=(6−2)=4,b=(6+2)=8,c=(6×2)=12a=(6-2)=4,b=(6+2)=8,c=(6\\times 2)=12a=(6−2)=4,b=(6+2)=8,c=(6×2)=12. We can see that a,b,ca,b,ca,b,c are in AP."
